    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlement is a couch-co-op game where you battle your friends as an elemental warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, liquefy, electrocute or kill your friends with any of the elemental powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here are some things you can do in the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have brutal slaughter fights with 2-4 elemental warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a good old game of tag... with a twist, of course!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to master all <strong>eight</strong> elemental warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change<strong> six</strong>\u00a0serene maps into a hellish bloodbath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a king in all<strong>\u00a0Nine\u00a0</strong>different game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch one of the many <strong>powerups</strong> and experience their magical effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.poster.avif?t=1755513943\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.webm?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.mp4?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance your powers by showing your true face:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>special move</strong> to inflict wild wounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait until you've charged enough energy and transform into<strong> ultramode</strong>\u00a0to unlock your inner beast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.poster.avif?t=1755513943\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.webm?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.mp4?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these powers wisely to eliminate your opponent when they least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can use keyboard + mouse per computer. So playing locally requires controllers for the other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlement is a couch-co-op game. There is no singleplayer mode and no bots. Make sure to bring a friend!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlement is a couch-co-op game where you battle your friends as an elemental warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, liquefy, electrocute or kill your friends with any of the elemental powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here are some things you can do in the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have brutal slaughter fights with 2-4 elemental warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a good old game of tag... with a twist, of course!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to master all <strong>eight</strong> elemental warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change<strong> six</strong>\u00a0serene maps into a hellish bloodbath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a king in all<strong>\u00a0Nine\u00a0</strong>different game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch one of the many <strong>powerups</strong> and experience their magical effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.poster.avif?t=1755513943\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.webm?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/71687b1b2a627e07f731ea35fac87504.mp4?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance your powers by showing your true face:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>special move</strong> to inflict wild wounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait until you've charged enough energy and transform into<strong> ultramode</strong>\u00a0to unlock your inner beast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.poster.avif?t=1755513943\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.webm?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726010/extras/919cdc3d5973f16b8c250edba0666e49.mp4?t=1755513943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these powers wisely to eliminate your opponent when they least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can use keyboard + mouse per computer. So playing locally requires controllers for the other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlement is a couch-co-op game. There is no singleplayer mode and no bots. Make sure to bring a friend!</p></li></ul>",
